| Design decisions           | docs/context/design-decisions.md |

## Context files
- A module's `CLAUDE.md` holds why it is built that way, its rules and its gotchas. A line an
  agent could learn from the code does not belong in it.
- When the owner explains a design choice, write it to `docs/context/design-decisions.md` or the
  module's `CLAUDE.md` in the same turn.
- Lines leave a context file only through `.claude/hooks/context_upkeep.py` (`move`, `restore`),
  never by deletion. `.claude/hooks/context_check.py` is the authority on the size budgets.

